                    <path d={`M ${apertureX - 6} ${apertureY - 19} H ${apertureX - 18} V ${apertureY - 7} M ${apertureX + 6} ${apertureY - 19} H ${apertureX + 18} V ${apertureY - 7} M ${apertureX - 18} ${apertureY + 7} V ${apertureY + 19} H ${apertureX - 6} M ${apertureX + 18} ${apertureY + 7} V ${apertureY + 19} H ${apertureX + 6}`} fill="none" stroke={C.coral} strokeWidth={1.7} opacity={0.62} strokeLinecap="square" />
                    {active > 0.01 && <path d={`M ${apertureX - 29} ${apertureY - 21} V ${apertureY - 29} H ${apertureX - 21} M ${apertureX + 21} ${apertureY + 29} H ${apertureX + 29} V ${apertureY + 21}`} fill="none" stroke={C.coral} strokeWidth={1.2} opacity={active * 0.76} />}
                    <rect x={27 + packetTravel * packetProgress} y={apertureY + 49.5} width={11} height={5} rx={0.8} fill="#84918E" opacity={packetOpacity * 0.78} />
